OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMore NHS staff sacked over attacks
OL,4,Avictims' records
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May, Nottingham University Hospitals
OL,7,F(NUH) NHS Trust confirmed it had
OL,8,Fdismissed 11 members of staff and, in
OL,9,Fan update on Friday, said a total of 15
OL,10,Fpeople had now been sacked as part of
OL,11,Fits investigation.
OL,13,FThe families of Barnaby, Grace and Ian
OL,14,Fpreviously welcomed the action taken by
OL,15,Fthe trust but called the development in
OL,16,FMay a "kick in the teeth".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
