OL,3,AUK must protect against Russian 'hybrid
OL,4,Aattacks', ex-national security adviser
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government must do more to protect
OL,8,Fkey infrastructure against "hybrid
OL,9,Fattacks" from Russia, a former national
OL,10,Fsecurity adviser has told the BBC.
OL,12,FLord Ricketts said more money should be
OL,13,Fspent on the defence budget, as well as
OL,14,Fimproving the resilience of energy,
OL,15,Ftransport and air traffic control.
OL,17,FHe warned hybrid attacks were becoming
OL,18,F"more reckless, more dangerous" and
OL,19,Fthat people could end up being killed.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
